ab-title = Everyday things, said once.
ab-lede = What a household asks for, and what Nestor does with it.
ab-1-ask = Turn everything off, we’re leaving.
ab-1-name = The house
ab-1-text = Lights, heating, music: through Home Assistant, and it checks it’s done.
ab-2-ask = Remind me to take my medicine at eight.
ab-2-name = Reminders that find you
ab-2-text = Said in the room you’re in, sent to your phone if you’re out. It never wakes the house.
ab-3-ask = Jules is allergic to peanuts.
ab-3-name = A memory for each person
ab-3-text = Kept and brought up when it matters. You can read, correct or erase it.
ab-4-ask = Plan our weekend in the mountains with the kids.
ab-4-name = Long errands, handed off
ab-4-text = Another agent works on it while you talk. Nestor tells you when it’s ready.
ab-5-ask = What’s on today?
ab-5-name = The morning, in one sentence
ab-5-text = Who has school, who has an appointment, what’s due: for each person.
ab-6-ask = Pasta in ten minutes, the oven in twenty-five.
ab-6-name = Hands busy
ab-6-text = Timers by voice, in the right room, with no screen to touch.
int-title = It works with what you already have.
